  "item_short_desc": "<p>Let your little ones embark on adventures with Rothco's Kids Camo T-Shirt. Whether they're building forts, blazing trails, or just exploring the backyard, our camouflage t-shirts are made for action. Featuring bold, realistic camo patterns and a comfy crewneck fit, these short sleeve shirts are perfect for young adventurers who live for the outdoors&mdash;hiking, camping, fishing, or whatever the day brings.</p>",
  "no_ratings": null,
  "sort_order": "14369",
  "description": "<p>Let your little ones embark on adventures with Rothco's Kids Camo T-Shirt. Whether they're building forts, blazing trails, or just exploring the backyard, our camouflage t-shirts are made for action. Featuring bold, realistic camo patterns and a comfy crewneck fit, these short sleeve shirts are perfect for young adventurers who live for the outdoors&mdash;hiking, camping, fishing, or whatever the day brings. Comfortable Materials: The tough-yet-soft cotton / polyester fabric blend easily handles rough-and-tumble adventures, while reinforced seams add extra strength where it counts. Plus, the tag-less neck means zero distractions, just all-day comfort for nonstop explorers. Great for Layering: The camouflage tee is designed to be the ideal base layer for outdoor activities in any season. Lightweight yet durable, the crewneck shirt fits easily under vests, hoodies, jackets, or coats, perfect for year-round wear. Moves with Every Mission: These camo t-shirts are standard fit, giving your young adventurer room and flexibility for various activities. Our shirts sit approximately at the waist for full coverage. The ribbed knit neck collar and wrist cuffs allow for a close fit without restricting movement. All Things Camo: Rothco stands out as the leader in camouflage clothing and accessories. With a rich heritage spanning over 7 decades, we have honed our expertise in crafting durable and effective camouflage gear. Our extensive range of products, including apparel, bags, and gear, showcases a diverse selection of camouflage, with over 35 patterns available! From outdoor enthusiasts and military personnel to skate and fashion, Rothco is the go-to brand for camo.</p>",
